00:08:53.425 --> 00:08:54.656
- Oh.
- Look at that.

00:08:54.656 --> 00:08:55.928
(laughing)
- Is it different?

00:08:55.928 --> 00:08:57.088
- Right?
(laughing)

00:08:57.088 --> 00:08:58.608
I'm definitely not adopted.

00:08:58.608 --> 00:08:59.712
- We had a lot of outfits, I don't know

00:08:59.712 --> 00:09:02.730
how many we had, but this outfit,

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:06.105
a few years later, was
what I was married in.

00:09:06.105 --> 00:09:07.932
- I don't think I connected the two.

00:09:07.932 --> 00:09:08.765
- Right.

00:09:08.765 --> 00:09:11.863
And these were the ones
who were the best man

00:09:11.863 --> 00:09:13.568
and ushers at the wedding.

00:09:13.568 --> 00:09:16.896
After the wedding, we performed.

00:09:16.896 --> 00:09:19.479
♫ Down our way

00:09:21.049 --> 00:09:22.700
And the last song we performed was a song

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.469
called "The Auctioneer" and they auctioned

00:09:24.469 --> 00:09:27.386
me off and Patty, your mom, got me.

00:09:28.301 --> 00:09:29.324
She bid on me and got me.

00:09:29.324 --> 00:09:31.255
- Did any other woman give
her a run for her money?

00:09:31.255 --> 00:09:32.088
- No.

00:09:32.088 --> 00:09:33.437
They wouldn't dare.
(laughing)

00:09:33.437 --> 00:09:37.989
- Like one of them was
like, "I also bid on Don."

00:09:37.989 --> 00:09:40.406
Our voices blend very well
because we have the same voice.

00:09:40.406 --> 00:09:42.302
- Yeah.
(laughing)

00:09:42.302 --> 00:09:45.315
- These three guys are
part of my groomsmen,

00:09:45.315 --> 00:09:46.635
so we decided we would Photoshop

00:09:46.635 --> 00:09:48.330
all of us into your photo.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.298
- Oh.
(laughing)

00:09:50.298 --> 00:09:51.131
That's funny.

00:09:51.131 --> 00:09:51.964
- [Eugene] So are you ready to see it?

00:09:51.964 --> 00:09:54.547
